@page
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
}

<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
        <h1>A student library, hosted by GoTVET.</h1>
        <p class="lead">GoTVET is a free way for South African TVET students to find and download past papers. All files in this test run live on the GoTVET server.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
        <h2>What is here now</h2>
        <p>The placeholder library includes Mathematics and English for NC(V) Levels 2, 3 and 4, with a question paper and memorandum for each. These are test files so the website and desktop app can be checked before the full set is added.</p>
        <h2>What comes next</h2>
        <p>When the full subject list and papers are provided, they will be stored here and will appear automatically in the website and the Windows app.</p>
    </div>
</section>
